+
+/**
+ * Creates a program, attaches shaders, binds attrib locations, links the
+ * program and calls useProgram.
+ * @param {!Array.<!WebGLShader|string>} shaders The shaders to
+ *        attach, or the source, or the id of a script to get
+ *        the source from.
